    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_audio_se_cache" kindref="compound">AudioSeCache</ref> provides an interface for accessing sound effects. It also provides an automatic cache management, any SE is only decoded once, otherwise returned from the cache. The cache is flushed from recently (&gt;10 seconds by default) unused samples when it reaches the memory limit (5 MB by default). Uses an internal <ref refid="class_audio_decoder" kindref="compound">AudioDecoder</ref> for handling the decoding. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
